<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">FlashSVD v1.5: Making Low-Rank Transformers Inference Actually Fast</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Wenhao Wu<sup id="id1" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1,∗</span></sup>
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Zishan Shao<sup id="id2" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1,2,∗,†</span></sup>
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
